# Rust
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# USB captures: large and machine-specific. Decoded findings live in
# docs/PROTOCOL.md instead.
*.pcapng
*.pcap

# Device dumps, except the captured config blocks that document the
# per-key and solid lighting modes.
*.bin
!reference/captured-config.bin
!reference/custom-mode-config.bin

# User content created at runtime
/animations/*.json
